n 3690 East Ave., Rochester, NY 14618 FLSA Exempt Salary / Hourly Range $96,500.00 - $113,500.00 per year Note The salary range for this role is set based on a variety of factors, including but not limited to internal equity, qualifications, experience, and education. The above hiring range is one component of the University’s competitive Total Rewards package which can be viewed here Posting Detail Information Posting Number F00185P Desired Start Date 08/16/2027 Open Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicant Required Application Materials Cover letter Curriculum Vitae Three recommendation letters or contact information for three references Additional Materials (Requested for Finalists) Teaching philosophy Research statement Student course evaluations (for candidates with teaching experience) Publications and working papers Official transcripts (required before appointment) Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Cover Letter Optional Documents Other Document 3690 East Avenue Rochester, New York 14618 (585) 385-8000 Back to top Copyright © St. John Fisher University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
